 "intro_html": "“Parent-and-child” rice bowl. The chicken sits in the sauce — <b>kombu, dashi, soy, mirin, sake and sugar</b> — while finely chopped ginger and onion soften in the pan with a pinch of salt. Then the chicken goes in with all of its marinade, gets bound with <b>barely set egg</b> poured in two stages, and slides over hot rice.",
