   "title": "Chicken in, with all the marinade",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Fish out the kombu.</li><li>Drizzle <b>about two-thirds</b> of the egg in a circle over the chicken and onion.</li><li>Cover and cook until the egg at the edges is set but the top is still runny.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-8",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Pour ⅔ of the egg",
